            "id": 6670112,
            "title": "〈焦點股〉南亞受惠法人反手轉買按讚 盤中爆量亮燈衝上漲停板",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台股上周慘跌7,600多點，創史上最大單周跌點紀錄，金管會今(23)日起祭出禁空令3.0救市，塑化股南亞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1303-TW</a>)今日隨大盤黑翻紅，盤中在大單敲進下，加上外資由連7賣轉買、投信中止連4賣轉買激勵下，量增12.5萬張衝上漲停價226.5元，一吐上周怨氣站回半年線。</p></section><p><template id=\"P:1\"></template></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>南亞今日受惠禁空令、國安基金場內挹注，今日走出逆勢反彈行情，早盤跌至196元，一度跌破200元整數關卡，盤中在量增價揚激勵下，亮燈攻上漲停板，盤中也已超過上周四、五，2天總成交量。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>法人表示，南亞受惠於電子材料轉型有成，以目前本益比觀察還不到14倍，且隨著AI材料出貨挹注下，明(2026)年有望維持佳績，也吸引法人持續進場。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>今日盤面上，塑化族群在盤中也全面復活，包括台塑化(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6505:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6505\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6505-TW</a>)、台化(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1326:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1326\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1326-TW</a>)一度飆漲半根停板。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>其他包括台塑(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1301:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1301\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1301-TW</a>)漲幅超過3%以上，其他二線塑化股的永捷(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4714:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4714-TW</a>)、信立(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4303-TW</a>)、中華化(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1727:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1727\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1727-TW</a>)、中石化(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1314:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1314\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1314-TW</a>)漲幅也逾2-3%。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>/法人指出，南亞近期股價曾跌破短期及半年線，短線結構偏弱，技術指標如MACD、RSI與日周月KD同步走低，顯示先前賣壓沉重，近一周外資雖連日買超，但後續觀察重點仍在漲停後，能否持續帶量站上短中期均線。</p></section></main>",
